  "TEMPLATED tpl_almanac · land.day.bind.day": "A small plan with a partner or the people you live with comes together easily today. Your evening at home asks for your time over your errands.",
  "TEMPLATED tpl_almanac · land.day.bind.hour": "Someone younger seeks you out today, for help or simply to be near you. A plan for later firms up as well, and it asks for your word.",
  "TEMPLATED tpl_almanac · land.day.bind.month": "Work pulls together today, and a colleague who kept apart joins your side. A stalled task starts moving again, and it asks you to keep pace with it.",
  "TEMPLATED tpl_almanac · land.day.bind.year": "Someone from the home you grew up in reaches out, with a call, a message or an old family joke. A reply asks for an hour of your day and a little of your guard.",
  "TEMPLATED tpl_almanac · land.day.clash.day": "A plan at home changes at short notice, with a partner or whoever you live with. Giving it up costs you the evening you had set aside.",
  "TEMPLATED tpl_almanac · land.day.clash.hour": "Something you promised for later gets pushed back, a date with someone younger or a step in a long plan. The delay costs you a piece of their trust and your own timetable.",
  "TEMPLATED tpl_almanac · land.day.clash.month": "A plan you settled at work comes loose, and someone asks you to defend it. Defending it takes time and patience you had meant for other tasks.",
  "TEMPLATED tpl_almanac · land.day.clash.year": "News from the family you grew up in changes a plan without warning, a visit moved or a date dropped. Rearranging around it takes a slice of your week.",
  "TEMPLATED tpl_almanac · land.day.frame.day": "Home gathers strength, with a partner or the people you live with pulling the same way. Shared chores go faster with every pair of hands, your own included.",
  "TEMPLATED tpl_almanac · land.day.frame.hour": "Younger people gather round your ideas, and a long plan picks up speed. Something you set going a while back now asks for your steering.",
  "TEMPLATED tpl_almanac · land.day.frame.month": "Momentum builds at work, and people line up behind a task you care about. Leading it today asks for more of your hours than you had set aside.",
  "TEMPLATED tpl_almanac · land.day.frame.year": "Relatives from your first home gather round in person or by message, and old ties pull tight again. Their eyes turn to you as the one at the centre.",
  "TEMPLATED tpl_almanac · land.day.harm.day": "A small thing at home is misread, a look or a tone a partner takes differently from how you meant it. The evening loses some of its ease while the doubt sits with you.",
  "TEMPLATED tpl_almanac · land.day.harm.hour": "A young person you guide feels passed over, or a plan for later loses a little of its shine. Noticing the quiet change takes your full attention.",
  "TEMPLATED tpl_almanac · land.day.harm.month": "A colleague takes a word of yours the wrong way, and the air at work cools a little. Clearing it costs you a plain conversation you would rather skip.",
  "TEMPLATED tpl_almanac · land.day.harm.year": "A remark from an older relative lands wrong, though nobody meant it unkindly. It stings more than its size, and the sting stays with you through the day.",
  "TEMPLATED tpl_almanac · land.day.punish.day": "An old argument at home comes back, or a chore that never stays done. Going round it once more costs your evening and some of your patience.",
  "TEMPLATED tpl_almanac · land.day.punish.hour": "A younger person tests the same limit again, or a long plan sticks at its usual snag. Holding the line asks for a calm you have to find twice over.",
  "TEMPLATED tpl_almanac · land.day.punish.month": "Friction at work returns, the same complaint from the same quarter as before. Answering it again eats into hours you had planned for something new.",
  "TEMPLATED tpl_almanac · land.day.punish.year": "An old disagreement from your first home stirs again, over the same small point as before. Hearing it out once more draws on a patience your day had meant for other things.",
  "TEMPLATED tpl_almanac · land.day.repeat.day": "Home repeats an old pattern, the same talk over dinner or the same small habit. Seeing it plainly asks you to decide which part you still want.",
  "TEMPLATED tpl_almanac · land.day.repeat.hour": "An old plan for later returns in nearly its first form, or a young person asks the same question twice. Each return asks for an answer clearer than your last one.",
  "TEMPLATED tpl_almanac · land.day.repeat.month": "Work brings back a task you thought was finished, or a meeting that covers familiar points. Old steps take fresh hours, while your newer work waits behind them.",
  "TEMPLATED tpl_almanac · land.day.repeat.year": "An old family story comes up again, told the way it always is. One part of it sounds different this time, and it points back at you.",
  "TEMPLATED tpl_almanac · land.month.bind.day": "The ties at home tighten this month, and a shared plan with a partner or the people you live with settles. Each evening brings you back to a calmer house.",
  "TEMPLATED tpl_almanac · land.month.bind.hour": "Bonds with the people after you deepen this month, a child, a younger relative or someone you train. Small gestures of care pass between you, and they ask for your time in return.",
  "TEMPLATED tpl_almanac · land.month.bind.month": "Your place at work settles this month, and an agreement with a colleague or a client holds firm. Steadier support stands behind your tasks week by week.",
  "TEMPLATED tpl_almanac · land.month.bind.year": "The family you grew up in draws you back this month, through visits, old recipes or a shared decision. Ease with them returns after a long while, along with their claims on your time.",
  "TEMPLATED tpl_almanac · land.month.clash.day": "Your home life is shaken up this month, in the furniture, the plans or the shape of a shared week. Old habits with the people closest to you stop working, and new ones cost you effort to build.",
