  "TEMPLATED tpl_almanac · land.month.frame.year": "Your wider family pulls together this month around an event or a shared need. Their call on your strength comes often, and answering it fills your weekends.",
  "TEMPLATED tpl_almanac · land.month.harm.day": "Little misreadings gather at home this month, with a partner or the people you live with. Each one is small, though together they wear on your evenings.",
  "TEMPLATED tpl_almanac · land.month.harm.hour": "This month a quiet gap opens between you and someone you teach or look after. Words do little to close it, and it asks for your time instead.",
  "TEMPLATED tpl_almanac · land.month.harm.month": "Small slights pile up at work this month, a credit not given or a message left unread. Keeping your own record straight costs you calm with each one.",
  "TEMPLATED tpl_almanac · land.month.harm.year": "A coolness creeps into the family you grew up in this month, from a word taken badly or a call left unreturned. The distance costs you the easy warmth of a usual call home.",
  "TEMPLATED tpl_almanac · land.month.punish.day": "An old sore point at home keeps returning this month, usually over who does what. Each round draws on your patience, and the weeks give little rest between them.",
  "TEMPLATED tpl_almanac · land.month.punish.hour": "A long plan keeps catching on the same problem this month, while someone younger pushes against your rules. Your patience is tested week after week.",
